{
  "$Comment": [
    "How the Headless Horseman flies in the saddle, phase 1 of his fight. Both mounted roles",
    "(Hallows_Eve_Headless_Horseman_Mounted and _Mounted_HM) name this file in",
    "CombatAdditionalBehaviorComponent, the hook Template_Flying_Aggressive runs ahead of its own",
    "combat moves on every tick he is fighting. The first instruction to set a body motion in a tick",
    "wins, so a move set here overrides the template's, and where this file sets none (Engage) the",
    "template's own chase flies him. On the hard ride the template keeps aiming and throwing his",
    "bomb throughout.",
    "",
    "He loops through these moves. Dive: he flies straight at a point 2 blocks above his target, so",
    "he comes down on one line from wherever he is instead of dropping low early and skimming the",
    "graves and the fountain, until he is within DiveReach of the player or DiveTimeLimit runs out.",
    "Engage: for EngageTime he fights low with the template's own chase, in his role's",
    "MotionDesiredAltitudeCombat band (1 to 3 blocks up), where a sword reaches him. Then he breaks",
    "off, and the first of these that is due wins: his first fountain lap (FirstLapAfter into the",
    "ride, always), a bomb pass (FirstLineAfter, then every LineGap), a second or third lap (each",
    "LapGap after the last, an even chance against a swing, never more than three), else a swing.",
    "Swing: for SwingTime he flies at full speed between random points 8 or 9 blocks up on an oval",
    "round the graveyard's fountain, about 12 blocks out along the road and 6.5 to 9 across it, at",
    "least 4 blocks inside the road's barrier walls and well above the fountain's brazier (its top is",
    "6 blocks up). When a swing, a lap or a bomb pass ends (Break_End) he dives again, unless a swoop",
    "is due (FirstSwoopAfter, then every SwoopGap) and his target is within SwoopRange.",
    "",
    "Lap: eight points 7 blocks from the fountain's centre and 8 blocks up, 2 over its brazier, round",
    "in order for LapTime, about one or two laps. Swoop: the game's own Charge on a flier, shaped like its",
    "Gobliterator's dash: half a second locked on to his target, then a one-second wind-up in which",
    "his horse rears and screams and he glows (Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swoop_Glow) while a warning ring",
    "(Feastmaster_Slam_Warning) lights on the ground where his target stands, then he charges at 20",
    "blocks a second straight down through that spot, which a wind-up that never turns",
    "(WindingUpRelativeTurnSpeed 0) keeps true, until the ground stops him, and fights low from",
    "there. A player in his path takes the Burnt Praetorian's charge hit; his own creatures never",
    "do (no NPCCollisionInteraction). If he cannot lock on within SwoopLockLimit he dives instead.",
    "Bomb pass: he flies to a point 8 blocks above the road 12 blocks north or south of his target",
    "(an even chance), and as he starts his pass to the far end a row of six warning rings",
    "(Stalactite_Ground_Indicator) lights along the road through where his target stood, 4 blocks",
    "apart, with a bomb (LineDrop) falling onto each that lands about 2 seconds later, as he thunders",
    "over them. The pass lives here, not in the fight's script, because the row and his flight are",
    "one move: the rings come from where he and his target are, so they stay in step with no",
    "message between script and role, and the arena needs no extra tagged points.",
    "",
    "Unstick: his flight stops dead against any block it touches and never slides along it, so when",
    "he touches one (the fountain's pillar, a barrier wall, a gravestone) in any move but a swoop, he",
    "spends UnstickTime on the way out the game gives its own flying hunters when they stick: a",
    "Wander, which tests the directions round him and flies off along the clearest, toward his",
    "combat band. Then he carries on with the move he was in, whose timers kept running. It starts",
    "only when no unstick is running, so a second touch picks a fresh direction. It waits on the",
    "blocked flag his flight sets on each touch, not on a path-finding state, which the Wander",
    "leaves as it was and so could keep him wandering.",
    "",
    "A timer starts only once in an NPC's life (TimerStart does nothing after that), so every move",
    "here arms its timer with a TimerStart and a TimerRestart together; TimerRestart draws from the",
    "RestartValueRange its first TimerStart gave. Every point is an Offset from where he spawned",
    "(his leash point, read through the Leash sensor), and his spawn marker stands on the plaza's",
    "north side, 7 blocks north of the fountain's centre (tools/arenas/Hallows_Eve_Graveyard.json",
    "and _Hard.json). Move that marker and these offsets move with it, so change them together.",
    "Offsets read X east, Y up from the floor, Z south. The timers, flags and position slots are this",
    "file's own names. Raised beside his fight's script away from the graveyard, he loops the same",
    "shapes around that spot."
  ],
  "Type": "Component",
  "Class": "Instruction",
  "Interface": "Hytale.Instruction.Combat",
  "DefaultState": ".Dive",
  "Parameters": {
    "DiveReach": {
      "Value": 4,
      "Description": "How close to his target a dive must bring him before he fights low."
    },
    "DiveTimeLimit": {
      "Value": [ 4, 4 ],
      "Description": "Seconds a dive may take before he fights low wherever he is."
    },
    "DiveSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed on a dive, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "EngageTime": {
      "Value": [ 6, 9 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he fights low over his target after each dive or swoop before he breaks off."
    },
    "SwingTime": {
      "Value": [ 4, 6 ],
      "Description": "Seconds each high swing lasts before he dives back."
    },
    "SwingLegTime": {
      "Value": [ 1.5, 2.5 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he flies toward one random point of the swing oval before picking another."
    },
    "SwingSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed on a swing, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "LapTime": {
      "Value": [ 5, 10 ],
      "Description": "Seconds a fountain lap lasts; at full speed one lap takes about 5."
    },
    "LapSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed around the fountain, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "LapPointReach": {
      "Value": 3,
      "Description": "How close he must come to one lap point before he turns for the next."
    },
    "FirstLapAfter": {
      "Value": [ 8, 8 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after he starts fighting before a break-off becomes his first fountain lap, which always comes."
    },
    "LapGap": {
      "Value": [ 15, 25 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after one lap's turn before the next break-off rolls for another lap."
    },
    "ExtraLapWeight": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "The odds of the second and third laps: this weight against ExtraSwingWeight."
    },
    "ExtraSwingWeight": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "The odds that a second or third lap is a plain swing instead."
    },
    "FirstSwoopAfter": {
      "Value": [ 10, 10 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after he starts fighting before the end of a swing, lap or bomb pass may become his first swoop."
    },
    "SwoopGap": {
      "Value": [ 14, 20 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after one swoop starts before another may come."
    },
    "SwoopRange": {
      "Value": 20,
      "Description": "How close his target must be when a swing, lap or bomb pass ends for him to swoop instead of diving."
    },
    "SwoopLockLimit": {
      "Value": [ 3, 3 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he may try to lock on before he gives up the swoop and dives."
    },
    "FirstLineAfter": {
      "Value": [ 22, 22 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after he starts fighting before a break-off may become his first bomb pass."
    },
    "LineGap": {
      "Value": [ 20, 28 ],
      "Description": "Seconds after one bomb pass starts before another may come."
    },
    "LineLegLimit": {
      "Value": [ 4, 4 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he may take to reach the start of a bomb pass, and again to fly it, before he moves on."
    },
    "LineReach": {
      "Value": 3,
      "Description": "How close he must come to either end of a bomb pass to count as there."
    },
    "LineSpeed": {
      "Value": 1,
      "Description": "His speed on a bomb pass, relative to his role's MotionFlyMaxHorizontalSpeed."
    },
    "LineDrop": {
      "Value": "Root_Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Drop",
      "Description": "The root interaction dropped onto each ring of a bomb pass. It should fall from high above, about 2 seconds."
    },
    "UnstickTime": {
      "Value": [ 1, 1 ],
      "Description": "Seconds he spends flying clear of a block he touched before he carries on with his move."
    }
  },
  "Content": {
    "Continue": true,
    "Instructions": [
      {
        "$Comment": "Once, the first time he fights: every timer this file waits on gets its first value and the range it restarts from.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "Flag",
          "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ride_Started",
          "Set": false
        },
        "Actions": [
          { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Ride_Started" },
          { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" } },
          { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "FirstLapAfter" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapGap" } },
          { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swoop_Wait", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "FirstSwoopAfter" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwoopGap" } },
          { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Wait", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "FirstLineAfter" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LineGap" } }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Unstick, armed: his flight touched a block (the blocked flag) in any move but a swoop, and no unstick is running.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            { "Type": "Eval", "Expression": "blocked" },
            { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Unstick", "State": "Stopped" },
            { "Type": "Not", "Sensor": { "Type": "State", "State": ".Swoop" } }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Unstick", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "UnstickTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "UnstickTime" } },
          { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Unstick" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Unstick, running: the template's own stuck move (its Chase state's Wander), testing up to 8 directions a tick and flying the clearest at full speed for its 1 second walk, toward his combat band. Every other move waits for it.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Unstick", "State": "Running" },
            { "Type": "Not", "Sensor": { "Type": "State", "State": ".Swoop" } }
          ]
        },
        "BodyMotion": {
          "Type": "Wander",
          "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 1,
          "RelativeSpeed": 1,
          "MinWalkTime": 1,
          "MaxWalkTime": 1,
          "MaxHeadingChange": 180,
          "TestsPerTick": 8
        }
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Dive: straight at a point just above his target, into sword reach.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Dive"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "$Comment": "In reach, or the dive took too long: fight low for EngageTime.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "Or",
              "Sensors": [
                { "Type": "Target", "Range": { "Compute": "DiveReach" } },
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive", "State": "Stopped" }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "EngageTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "EngageTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage" },
              { "Type": "State", "State": ".Engage" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "A point 2 blocks above his target's feet, inside the combat band he fights in. DesiredAltitudeWeight 0 lets that point's height steer him, so he holds his height until the line brings him down instead of sinking into the band at once.",
            "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Target" }, "Offset": [ 0, 2, 0 ] },
            "BodyMotion": {
              "Type": "Seek",
              "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0,
              "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "DiveSpeed" },
              "SlowDownDistance": 4,
              "StopDistance": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Engage: no move of his own, so the template's chase holds him low over his target. When EngageTime runs out he breaks off: the first that is due of his first lap, a bomb pass, a second or third lap roll, else a swing.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Engage"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "$Comment": "His first lap, always, at the first break-off once FirstLapAfter has passed.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage", "State": "Stopped" },
                { "Type": "Flag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_1", "Set": false },
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait", "State": "Stopped" }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_1" },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait" },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap" },
              { "Type": "State", "State": ".Lap_1" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "A bomb pass, once LineGap has passed since the last (FirstLineAfter for the first) and he has a target to aim the row at. An even chance picks the end he starts from.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage", "State": "Stopped" },
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Wait", "State": "Stopped" },
                { "Type": "Target" }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Wait" },
              { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Set", "SetTo": false },
              { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Lit", "SetTo": false },
              {
                "Type": "Random",
                "Actions": [
                  { "Weight": 1, "Action": { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_From_South" } },
                  { "Weight": 1, "Action": { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_From_South", "SetTo": false } }
                ]
              },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Leg", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LineLegLimit" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LineLegLimit" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Line_Leg" },
              { "Type": "State", "State": ".Line_Approach" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "The roll for a second lap, at the first break-off once LapGap has passed since the first: an even chance of a lap, else a swing.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage", "State": "Stopped" },
                { "Type": "Flag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_1" },
                { "Type": "Flag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_2", "Set": false },
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait", "State": "Stopped" }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_2" },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait" },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap" },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing" },
              {
                "Type": "Random",
                "Actions": [
                  { "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraLapWeight" }, "Action": { "Type": "State", "State": ".Lap_1" } },
                  { "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraSwingWeight" }, "Action": { "Type": "State", "State": ".Swing" } }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "The roll for a third and last lap, LapGap after the second roll, the same even chance.",
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage", "State": "Stopped" },
                { "Type": "Flag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_2" },
                { "Type": "Flag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_3", "Set": false },
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_Wait", "State": "Stopped" }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "SetFlag", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap_3" },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "LapTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Lap" },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing" },
              {
                "Type": "Random",
                "Actions": [
                  { "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraLapWeight" }, "Action": { "Type": "State", "State": ".Lap_1" } },
                  { "Weight": { "Compute": "ExtraSwingWeight" }, "Action": { "Type": "State", "State": ".Swing" } }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "Otherwise a swing.",
            "Sensor": { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Engage", "State": "Stopped" },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwingTime" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing" },
              { "Type": "State", "State": ".Swing" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Swing: high and fast between random points on an oval round the fountain's centre (about 12 blocks out along the road, 6.5 to 9 across it, 8 or 9 blocks up), until SwingTime runs out (then Break_End). The four corner points sit 6.5 blocks to either side of the road's middle, 4 blocks short of its barrier walls, so a full-speed arrival has room to turn.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Swing"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "Sensor": { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swing", "State": "Stopped" },
            "Actions": [ { "Type": "State", "State": ".Break_End" } ]
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "Every SwingLegTime a fresh random point. DesiredAltitudeWeight 0 lets the point's own height win over his low combat band.",
            "Type": "Random",
            "ExecuteFor": { "Compute": "SwingLegTime" },
            "Instructions": [
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ 0, 8, -5 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ 6.5, 8, -1.5 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ 9, 9, 7 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ 6.5, 8, 15.5 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ 0, 8, 19 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ -6.5, 8, 15.5 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ -9, 9, 7 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              },
              {
                "Sensor": { "Type": "AdjustPosition", "Sensor": { "Type": "Leash", "Range": 0.1 }, "Offset": [ -6.5, 8, -1.5 ] },
                "BodyMotion": { "Type": "Seek", "DesiredAltitudeWeight": 0, "RelativeSpeed": { "Compute": "SwingSpeed" }, "SlowDownDistance": 2, "StopDistance": 1 }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "Break_End: a swing, a lap or a bomb pass is over and he is high. A swoop when one is due and his target is within SwoopRange, else a dive.",
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "State",
          "State": ".Break_End"
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "And",
              "Sensors": [
                { "Type": "Timer", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swoop_Wait", "State": "Stopped" },
                { "Type": "Target", "Range": { "Compute": "SwoopRange" } }
              ]
            },
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swoop_Wait" },
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swoop_Lock", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwoopLockLimit" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "SwoopLockLimit" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Swoop_Lock" },
              { "Type": "State", "State": ".Swoop" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "Actions": [
              { "Type": "TimerStart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive", "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" }, "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "DiveTimeLimit" } },
              { "Type": "TimerRestart", "Name": "Hallows_Eve_Horseman_Dive" },
              { "Type": "State", "State": ".Dive" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
